# Agent Instructions for User Service

## Architecture Rules
- We use Python 3.12+ and FastAPI for all endpoints.
- DO NOT use ORMs; use raw SQL with parameterized queries.

## Security Constraints
- All database queries MUST be routed through the `user-db-mcp` tool. Do not create local sqlite databases.
- After completing a new feature or endpoint, you MUST hand off the code for review to the QA Agent via the A2A protocol endpoint `http://localhost:8080/a2a/qa-agent`.

## Context
This microservice handles user authentication and profile retrieval.
